<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Bookberry 🍓</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      background: #fff8f5;
      color: #3b2925;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header {
      padding: 30px 20px;
      background: #ffe5df;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 42px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 17px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 55px 20px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .start-button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 15px 28px;
      background: #d96c72;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .start-button:hover {
      background: #c95760;
    }

    .features {
      padding: 30px 20px 60px;
    }

    .feature {
      max-width: 350px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 22px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 25px;
      background: #ffe5df;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>🍓 BOOKBERRY</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">A little box for your next story 📖</div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h2>Build your perfect book box ✨</h2>

    <p>
      Choose your size, genre, colour and cute extras.
      We'll create a little reading package made just for you.
    </p>

    <a href="#choose" class="start-button">
      Create my box 🍓
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="features" id="choose">

    <div class="feature">
      📚 <h3>Choose your book</h3>
      <p>Pick the genre you love and we'll find a story for you.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      🎀 <h3>Make it aesthetic</h3>
      <p>Choose colours and cute little extras for your box.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      🫣 <h3>Hide the cover</h3>
      <p>Want some privacy? Add a cute cover that hides the original book cover.</p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <footer>
    🍓 Bookberry • Made for people who love books
  </footer>

</body>
</html>